WEBVTT

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:42.160
Fault occurring in main Q.L. conduit!

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:45.800
Output dropping on defense field
generator number 3! It's overloaded!

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.400
Routing in auxiliary generator number 12!
Circuits to number 3 now closed!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.770
Charge, complete!

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:52.860
Then let's move out!

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:54.610
Entangle!

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:02.150
Number 2 and 3 auxiliary guns hit!
Heavy damage!

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.010
Emergency Q.L. shutoff, engaged!

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.550
Shit! Isn't there anything else we can do?!

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:07.680
Vice-Commander!

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.420
Offensive equipment operational
status down to 60 percent!

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:12.010
Damaged blocks now sealed off!

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:14.420
Commander Shima...

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.340
Yes, sir?

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:31.000
Altair... Garuda... Where?

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:33.440
They've vanished.

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.350
I... see...

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:40.110
They too have gone
to the world of fantasies...

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.820
Commander!

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.250
Commander, why are you smiling?!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.420
The mission's a failure!

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:50.290
We made it into G-Phaetus,
but we're surrounded by the enemy!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.990
Now... Now!

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:58.860
Form is nothingness...
Nothingness is form...

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:03.060
Commander! What are you talking about?!
Commander Shima!

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.550
What the hell is this?!

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.320
Data on the Earth of the past?

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:24.400
What's the big idea?

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.830
Kyo! This is an enemy trap!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.860
They're just playing with us!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.660
<i>I can't let myself be led astray.</i>
<i>The enemy isn't Naga.</i>

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:38.440
<i>It's Abyss and Sin,</i>
<i>the ones facing me now!</i>

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:44.610
And they're starting to piss me off!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.380
Kyo!

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.820
Is yelling all you can do, Kyo Sogoru?

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:56.830
He's a fool doomed to die who can
only mimic the form of color in life.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.130
The thoughts of our Naga
will never be conveyed...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.190
to a meta-body whose
evolution has stopped.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.260
What's that magic circle-looking thing?

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.620
It's a micro quantum portal.
It may as well be magic!

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.930
You have no chance of winning!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.060
You mean he can't run out of ammo?!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.310
How many more minutes can we fight?!

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:44.100
It looks like time passes
differently in here than outside.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:46.080
Our Q.L. isn't running out!

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:49.100
Meaning we can't retreat and neither can they!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.250
Isn't there a way
out of here, Lu-shen?!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.160
Our only option is to fight till we die!

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:02.120
We are <i>not</i> dying here!
There's no way I'll let that happen now!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.160
Yeah...
He's really taught me everything.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.300
About what?

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:13.260
About how to live.
And how you should die.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.610
It teleported?!

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.580
Kyo! Behind us, too!

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.320
It's split up?!

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.280
It only looks that way
because it's moving so fast!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.360
Energy supply from deutera is still stable.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:43.230
Even if we're not running out of Q.L.,
we're helpless against that thing, Lu-shen!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.270
Lu-shen?

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:47.940
Forgive me.
I can't act as as shield for you.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.170
What do you mean?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:52.580
<i>I wonder...</i>
<i>Is this all divine punishment for me?</i>

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.780
What are you talking about?!

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:59.250
When you were resurrected,
I didn't trust you.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:03.410
And now we're thrown together as a team
like this again. That's my punishment.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.760
Team? Then who's the funny man?
Am I straight man?!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.950
Kyo!

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.860
We're both the straight man!

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.790
The final operation has failed.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:23.210
Now... there's...

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:25.070
Now there's what?

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:27.480
There's only one place to go.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:33.310
All hands... Evacuate.
To the Maihama server.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.880
That's what he said?

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.190
Irie...

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:40.950
Kuroshio...

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:51.030
Forgive me... for dragging you along... with us...

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.030
Sir, please don't!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.510
In the end, we chose this path ourselves!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.590
Now go...

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.420
What about you?!

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.100
No!

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.160
I'll stay with you, Commander!
To the very end!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:28.830
For staying with me at my
side... until today... Thank you...

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.240
Commander!

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:34.140
Commander Shima!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.720
Let's go.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:46.410
For the man who fought
with his very soul... Salute!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.630
May we meet again,
in some other place.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.830
I pray that we will.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.050
Commander!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:23.650
Here he comes, Kyo!

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:25.930
Wants to finish us off, huh?

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:28.060
Let's see what kinda trick he pulls out of his hat.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:39.580
Impossible!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.640
Kyo!

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:53.090
I see... You've... finally... come...

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:57.020
Take care of the rest.

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.060
Sir!

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:06.170
Let 'em hit us, Lu-shen!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:08.240
<i>That's how you do things?</i>

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.370
IT'S ALL WE'VE GOT LEFT!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.270
Now, begone! KYO SOGORU!

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.060
They vanished?

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:30.530
Did the meta-bodies extinguish
their color themselves?

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.230
Impossible.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:35.130
Even if they did, they're still stubborn.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.670
They're still here.
They're hidden somewhere.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:39.830
I'll check for them!

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:49.950
Where are we?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.580
It looks like a server somewhere.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:55.840
Lu-shen and May-yu.

00:09:56.520 --> 00:10:00.460
Did somebody save us? But who?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.480
Kyo.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.270
Kaminagi!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.570
Let's go see.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:16.970
Right...

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.380
That cat...

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:23.380
It's beckoning us to follow?

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:26.150
What should we do? Kyo's going.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:32.620
<i>In the end, do I really live my</i>
<i>life according to my feelings?</i>

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:35.430
<i>Just like him...</i>

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:38.020
<i>have I lived only for</i>
<i>the sake of the one I loved?</i>

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:50.240
Oh!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.440
Sorry.

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.570
This is nothing.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.720
Man, I could really use
a can of tuna right now.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.590
Oil-free, right?

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:07.220
Right now,
I'd eat it dripping with oil!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.690
I'll get you one.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:10.890
Engines 2 and 3, stopped!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.990
Lift power, dropping rapidly!
We're falling!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.800
We have to keep fighting them
till the very end!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:20.200
Every minute and second now is our future!
And we're going to reach it!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:23.640
I'll never be able to talk
about the weather again.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:27.170
I'd like to ask you about it,
but I'm busy now. Sorry.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.150
Ricerca! Take over for Dita!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.850
Aye, sir!

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:38.020
Converting the Oceanus's
remaining Q.L. to layered form!

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:39.680
Very well.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.160
There are currently
1,815 facilities in operation.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.820
Where are you, meta-bodies?!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.170
You're not cold, are you, Kaminagi?

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:51.070
Uh-uh.

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.540
You okay, May-yu?

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.540
I'm fine.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:54.440
Lu-shen?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.460
Yeah.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:06.110
That's...

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.760
Commander Shima...

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.430
Then, it's?!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:17.760
Yeah.

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.160
The president's original?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.160
I've met him.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.730
Back when he was once
a close aide to Naga.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.480
What's this?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.680
Just try to visualize it.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.080
It's a collection server
of Earth's nature data.

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:48.120
There was a researcher who
concentrated on that once.

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.390
Even Naga allowed him to do it.
The hobby of an eccentric man, I suppose.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.970
I guess we should ignore it, then.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:57.560
Wait!

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:03.570
This is one of
my collection servers.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.370
You can consider it an archive
to preserve nature's legacy.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.210
We've entered phase three
of the operation.

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.320
So it would seem.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:16.010
There's something I want to show you.
Please follow me.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:25.760
I shared Naga's ideals.

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:30.670
Or rather, I was a scientist who
adored his technical expertise.

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:34.930
And so I became the first
volunteer for meta-body transfer.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:42.910
Once I'd become a meta-body,
I meditated within the flow of infinite time.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:46.910
Eventually, I began to question
Naga's way of thinking.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:51.590
Those doubts gave birth
to the one you know as Shima.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.030
That cat before...

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.580
Are you saying
the president is?!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.460
Death comes to all.
We meet only to part one day.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:01.860
What?!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.270
What's happened to the Oceanus?!

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.740
Is everyone all right?!
May-yen and the others?!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.830
The Cerebrants have been
stored in the Maihama server.

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.340
What about all the A.I.s?

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.650
Where's the Maihama server?!

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:22.850
In a lab left to my own control.
In other words, here.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.250
The server we're in is in the same lab.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.970
Now that the
Oceanus has been lost,

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:39.530
it'll be impossible for you to take the
resurrection system back with you.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.910
You'll have to destroy
the Gards-orm with the Zegas...

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:46.310
and then call for
another carrier from Earth.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.980
Easy for you to say!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:50.850
Exactly! We have no way
of replenishing our Q.L.!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:55.940
Some time ago, I sent the technique
of Q.L. layering to the Oceanus.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.960
Q.L. compression.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:04.800
Correct. It will drastically increase
the Zegapain's operational time.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.860
Why didn't you
get that to us sooner?!

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:10.320
It was originally developed
for moving the Maihama server.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.330
The method was only
perfected very recently.

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:20.110
I pray the A.I.s are able
to complete their final task.

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:24.750
Layered Q.L. will reach full
compression in 4 minutes, 30 seconds!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.850
Just that!
We just have to achieve that!

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.120
Forget it!
We can't hang around with you!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.690
I'm going back to the Zega!
Where is it?!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:41.330
The Zega is also outside this place.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.370
However, please wait.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:45.200
I won't wait!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.400
The Maihama server's right here
with us! If I don't protect it!

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:49.930
Kyo...

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.780
Can't you hear it?

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:56.750
Listen closely.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.820
The sound of water.

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.580
Is there a spring nearby?

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.520
The source of all life.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:10.260
This water is born from the sea,
becomes clouds, turns to snow...

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:12.420
and then finally rejoins the sea.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.970
What are you jabbering on about?!

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:18.130
Form is nothingness.
Nothingness is form.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:20.130
Is that the Heart sutra?!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:26.640
They've found us!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:29.140
He's coming!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.050
I'll go.

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.120
Tell me what you've seen.

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.180
Until then, leave the
Maihama server in my hands.

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:38.350
What are you saying that for...

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:42.990
You never can lie. Never...

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:45.120
That's what I love
so much about you.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:58.640
Was I just seriously kissed by a?

00:16:58.640 --> 00:16:59.700
Yeah.

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.550
Traitor!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.480
So, this is the server
containing Kyo and the others.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.720
Isn't that it?
The resurrection system?

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:18.590
Embraced with the Maihama server...
An appropriate coupling.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:21.600
Anyway, we can't let them touch this!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.690
You with me on this, May-yu?

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.660
Please don't ask me that.

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:30.510
The bulkhead's been breached!
Here they come!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.010
Oceanus!
Can you give us some Q.L.?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.680
<i>Can you take a low-phase burst?</i>

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:36.370
That'll do!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.740
<i>Q.L. charging, complete.</i>

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.460
Charging, complete!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:54.770
All right!
We're protecting the Maihama server!

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:55.160
Right!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.170
I finally understand.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:13.250
You wanted to become
like Kyo, didn't you?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:22.730
Holo-Bolt Breaker!

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:25.460
Roger! Holonic field, forming!

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.260
Holo-Bolt, physicalizing!

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:45.150
They're coming!

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.920
Hey! Let's go! Let's go!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.780
There we go. It's this.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:00.100
Form is nothingness.

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:04.200
All things which have color and
form in this world are transitory.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.700
Nothingness is form.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:10.110
But the moment when things which
have always existed are destroyed,

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:12.580
all sorts of other colors come to life.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.080
Indeed.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.380
I'm ready to punch you out!
Is this what you wanted to show me?!

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:26.160
Even admitting our lives are transient,
it's not like we live for nothing!

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.620
Isn't that... Isn't that why we fight?!

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:31.990
So, live for the moment...
Is that it?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.360
Naga had a different answer.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.840
Dry damage... and wet damage...

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:48.330
You're past the limit!
Lu-shen! Lu-shen!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.310
I'm glad...

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:54.250
I'm glad to feel this pain... This joy!

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.250
Lu-shen...

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.160
Maihama...

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:02.610
No. It's Kyo I'm protecting!

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.120
We make a good team!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:08.160
Don't you think so?
Don't you think so, Kyo?!

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.700
It's because of the person you are
that I wanted to show you.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.670
You're a pain in the ass, you idiot!

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.150
Zegapain...

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.170
Literally "the great pain."

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:30.750
May you become the first,
pure drop of the flood.

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:34.590
The rest, I leave to you.

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:39.660
Q.L. layering, complete!

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:44.030
All right!
We're ready to resupply the Altair!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.670
The future has been woven.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:54.740
Transfer Q.L. to Altair!

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:59.240
Quantum Loaded energy, direct transfer!

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:33.330
Incredible!
We've got a full Q.L. charge! Kyo!

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.510
Yeah! It looks like we're bursting with it!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:55.230
At long last, the time has come for the
peaceful days of Maihama to be smashed.

00:22:55.230 --> 00:22:57.930
I won't forgive them!
This place that I love so much...

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:00.900
I won't forgive them for trampling
on the people who live there!

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:02.410
Shizuno-sempai!

00:23:02.410 --> 00:23:07.010
While I defend the Maihama server,
get us back to Earth!

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:10.640
Even if it means having to say goodbye
to Kaminagi and everyone else.

00:23:11.350 --> 00:23:15.450
Next time, on Zegapain:
"Are the Skies of Maihama Blue?"

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.360
My pain, never to be forgotten.
